<category>
<pattern>WHAT IS CURRENT STATE OF FIDONET</pattern>
<template>FidoNet is a network of interconnected BBSes that continues to operate with Telnet-based connections. It is a legacy of the bulletin board system era and represents a niche but enduring legacy of the internet.</template>
